(h) to organize lectures, seminars and conferences witha view to promoting the objectives of the bodycorporate;

(i) to liaise and co-ordinate with other local and foreigninstitutions having similar objects to that of the bodycorporate; and

(j) to train officers and servants in Sri Lanka or abroadfor the purpose of the body corporate.

