BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:—

1.This Act may be cited as the Sri BalabhivurdhiWardana Society (Incorporation) Act, No. 12 of 2024.

(2) The body corporate shall be deemed to be a VoluntarySocial Service Organization within the meaning, and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Service Organizations(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the body corporate.

