Interpretation

Finance Act, No. 33 of 20235

“motor vehicle” means –

(a)any mechanically or electrically, or solarenergy propelled vehicle or vehiclepropelled by liquid petroleum gas orvehicle propelled by alternative fuelincluding a tractor or trailer which isintended or adapted for use on roads butdoes not include a road-roller;

(b)any mechanically or electrically or solarenergy propelled vehicle, or vehiclepropelled by liquid petroleum gas orvehicle propelled for alternative fuel orintended for use on land in connectionwith an agricultural or constructionalpurpose such as leveling, dredging,earthmoving, forestry or any similaroperation but does not include a road-roller; and

“tax” includes any tax, penalty, surcharge, levy,duty, charge for or contribution payable orlevied under the Acts referred to in Schedulein relation to import of a motor vehicle.

8. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.

